    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"earned the rest...\" you say that like it's a gift. But the weight of it is so much. I look at my sword, the one that's seen every tragedy I've lived through, and it's the only thing that doesn't feel like a lie anymore. It's the only thing that's still real in this ruin. It feels like it's waiting for me, or maybe I'm just waiting for it. It's just... so tired. Everything is just so tired.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
